{"version":1,"content":"<p>據Business Insider報道，OpenAI CEO山姆·奧特曼（Sam Altman）在史丹福大學的一次演講中表示，許多數學家對OpenAI進軍該領域的態度，已從最初「我們完了」的悲觀，轉向接受AI如今在數字與證明研究中無法剝離的角色。他面對的，是數百名對職業前景感到不安的學生。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583466.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:59:39.638049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:52:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:57:55.887816+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:57:55.887816+00:00","content_hash":"e902e896ad8aa222b525b0d39b1524b6dda9b7155a5ed1356d8e65ac3e4dfb32","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}